                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Baghdad, on August 9, reported information from an officer of the Rafidain Oil
                    Company, a subsidiary of the Anglo-Iranian Oil Company in Iraq, that the Iraqi
                    Government had granted permission for the Middle East Pipeline Company to start
                    a preliminary survey of territory in Southern Iraq for the eastern section and
                    terminus of its proposed pipeline to Syria (Airgram 109, 890.6363/8–948).</p>
            </div>
